+portfire continuity show.pf --catalog house.csv --rig autumn.rig --walk walk.csv --after after.csv
+```
+
+The panel's own log says which outputs closed and when, and `rehearse --log`
+grades it against the table: what never closed, what closed that the table
+has nothing on, and what closed late. The walk taken after the show says
+which matches burnt, and `continuity --after` turns that into the list of
+what is still loaded, when each position may be approached, and what can be
+relit. Both are written up in `docs/panel-record.md`.
